<section class="page-header">
<div class="container">
<p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><a href="/blog/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.9rem;text-decoration:none;">&larr; Back to Blog</a></p>
<h1>Christmas Travel 2026: Book Your Holiday Rental Now</h1>
<p>Christmas and New Year&#x27;s both land on Fridays this year. That&#x27;s two long weekends, and one 15-passenger van.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
<div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
<p>Christmas falls on <strong>Friday, December 25</strong> this year, and New Year's Day on <strong>Friday, January 1</strong>. That's two long weekends back to back, which means a lot of families hitting the road at the same time. If you need a vehicle for either one, now is the time to call.</p>
<h2>Match the vehicle to the trip</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>A couple heading to the in-laws:</strong> an <a href="/cheap-car-rental.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">intermediate car</a> at $55/day or $330/week for local renters, with unlimited mileage.</li>
<li><strong>More room for presents and luggage:</strong> a <a href="/full-size-car-rental.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">full-size car</a> at $65/day or $390/week for local renters.</li>
<li><strong>Snow in the forecast or a rural driveway at the other end:</strong> a <a href="/suv-rental.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">Ford Edge SUV or the AWD Subaru Outback</a> at $80/day or $480/week for local renters.</li>
<li><strong>The whole family plus the gifts:</strong> the <a href="/blog/7-passenger-minivan-rental-black-river-falls.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">7-passenger minivan</a> at $78/day plus $0.10/mile, or $450/week with unlimited miles for local renters.</li>
<li><strong>Everyone to one celebration:</strong> the <a href="/van-rental.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">15-passenger van</a> at $135/day plus $0.10/mile, or $750/week with unlimited miles for local renters.</li>
</ul>
<p>Non-local rates are intermediate $75/day or $450/week, full-size $85/day or $510/week, and SUV/AWD $100/day or $600/week, plus a per-mile charge. Call 715-396-1466 for the per-mile rate. Local means residents of Black River Falls and Jackson County, WI.</p>
<h2>Take the week, not the day</h2>
<p>Holiday trips stretch. A Wednesday pickup, Christmas with one side of the family, the weekend with the other, and a Monday drive home adds up to six days. At that point a weekly rate almost always wins, and local weekly rentals include unlimited mileage. The <a href="/blog/weekly-car-rental-rates-when-7-days-beats-daily.html" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;">weekly-rate breakdown</a> shows the math.</p>
<h2>Confirm holiday-week hours</h2>
<p>Our regular hours are Monday to Friday 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Saturday 8:00 AM to noon, and Sunday closed. After-hours drop-off returns are available. Hours can change around Christmas Eve, Christmas Day, New Year's Eve, and New Year's Day, so <strong>confirm your pickup and return times when you book</strong>. That way nobody is standing in a parking lot on December 24.</p>
<h2>The one-of-a-kind vehicles go first</h2>
<p>We have one 15-passenger van and one AWD Outback. Both are popular every December, between family travel and late-season hunters. If either one is the vehicle you need, call this week.</p>
<p><strong>Call or text 715-396-1466.</strong> Merry Christmas from the Riverside crew, family-owned in Black River Falls since 1983.</p>
<div style="margin-top:48px;">
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-list">
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">When should I book a rental for Christmas 2026?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Now. Christmas is Friday, December 25 and New Year&#x27;s Day is Friday, January 1, so both weekends are busy. The 15-passenger van and the AWD Outback are one of a kind in our fleet and book first.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">Are you open on Christmas and New Year&#x27;s?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Hours can change around Christmas Eve, Christmas Day, New Year&#x27;s Eve, and New Year&#x27;s Day. Call 715-396-1466 to confirm pickup and return times when you book. After-hours drop-off returns are available.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">Do weekly holiday rentals include unlimited miles?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes for local renters. Local weekly rentals of 7+ days include unlimited mileage, including $450/week for the minivan and $750/week for the 15-passenger van. Non-local rates are intermediate $75/day or $450/week, full-size $85/day or $510/week, and SUV/AWD $100/day or $600/week, plus a per-mile charge. Call 715-396-1466 for the per-mile rate. Local means residents of Black River Falls and Jackson County, WI.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">What&#x27;s the best rental for a big family Christmas?
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>The 7-passenger minivan fits most families with luggage and gifts. The 15-passenger van keeps a large extended family in one vehicle.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
